        "## 5. Inputs (features) and output (target)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Inputs (features)** are the readings the model will look at:\n",
        "- Air temperature\n",
        "- Process temperature\n",
        "- Rotational speed\n",
        "- Torque\n",
        "- Tool wear (how long the part has been in use)\n",
        "- Machine type (low, medium, high quality)\n",
        "\n",
